WEBVTT

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:39.470
Now,

00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:41.270
stand up with your legs.

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:53.320
Thank you, Lord Michael.

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:54.740
This is a miracle!

00:00:54.740 --> 00:00:56.950
Lord Michael has created a miracle!

00:00:57.530 --> 00:00:58.280
A miracle!

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:00.910
It's... a miracle...

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:04.330
Infiltration?

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:05.330
That's ridiculous.

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:08.880
If we want to find out what Michael is up to...

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:11.170
...that's the only way.

00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:13.840
It's too dangerous!

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:18.180
His followers are just like zombies, they don't fear death.

00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:40.990
That's why we must act quickly.

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:44.120
I will conduct the infiltration.

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:47.370
I can't let my fiancée be involved in such a dangerous situation.

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:50.590
I have to do it because I'm a woman.

00:01:50.590 --> 00:01:53.000
They wouldn't suspect a female agent.

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:55.170
Karen...

00:01:56.220 --> 00:02:00.640
You are all embraced by the Almighty God.

00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:05.730
Therefore, there is no need to fear death.

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:11.150
Are you frightened?

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:12.940
Not at all.

00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:13.940
Please shoot me.

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:17.450
My life is yours.

00:02:19.280 --> 00:02:21.120
How fabulous...

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:29.290
But if I could save a lost lamb with your death, that would be even better.

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:33.420
Now, pass this gun to someone you wish to save.

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:45.100
Natasha, please shoot me,

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:49.690
so that I may be able to sacrifice my life and soul to Lord Michael.

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:51.900
What are you talking about, Maria?

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:54.320
Well then...

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:16.300
It was a feint?

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:18.460
Thank you, Maria.

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:21.880
A woman like you

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:25.390
gives us strength in order to make our dreams come true.

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:32.020
It seems like you need a different teaching, Natasha.

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:33.980
Or should I say, Officer Karen.

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:14.270
I held my breath and kept waiting while my heart was scratched away

00:04:16.110 --> 00:04:25.620
A minute, a second never felt so long

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:37.380
I look up at the sky and ask the wind, "Can I fly now?"

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:43.670
The weak person I was is no more

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:49.260
I decided to just believe

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:56.400
With the dreams I once had in my hand now

00:04:56.400 --> 00:05:00.230
I go towards you

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:07.950
Carrying those emotions I felt when I broke

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:12.080
I go towards you

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:16.120
Blown by the wind

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:21.590
Oh blown

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:26.970
The Saint Who Smelled of Death

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:50.910
Mr. Duke Togo.

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:52.410
Thank you for coming.

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:54.750
Look straight ahead and speak.

00:05:57.420 --> 00:05:58.960
Kill...

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:00.750
Kill Michael for me.

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:02.170
Michael?

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:05.010
The head of the new cult group?

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:08.930
That was him ten years ago.

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:11.930
I heard that he doesn't show his face anymore.

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:13.390
Why him?

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:18.270
He creates an army of people who don't fear death,

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:20.520
and his power is increasing even as we speak.

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:24.820
If the police were to stop him now,

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:27.190
the amount of casualties would be high.

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:30.240
That's why the higher-ups aren't issuing any orders.

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:37.540
So, you want to use your own money to ask me to kill him for you?

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:42.790
To request an assassination, you don't need to tell me a fancy or moral story.

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:46.590
I just need to hear the truth.

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:54.260
He murdered my fiancée.

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:57.680
I loved her very much.

00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:00.980
So, please...

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:05.270
Please avenge her.

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:09.780
Tell me what you know about Michael.

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:13.530
You're going to accept it?

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:31.550
Michael shows miraculous healing powers in order to gather more followers,

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:36.560
then brainwashes them in order to turn them into fighting machines.

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:44.150
They're always hiding inside a high-rise building which they call his "castle."

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:45.560
Getting in is very difficult.

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:58.450
I have no idea why he's wearing a mask either.

00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:01.750
Some say that he got assaulted by a gangster and injured his face.

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:07.420
But, the only thing that matters is that he became ruthless after wearing that mask.

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:13.380
I will heal your illnesses.

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:14.680
Who will it be today?

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:20.270
He has a muscle degradation illness, and his lower legs have no strength.

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:21.680
He can't even crawl.

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:29.190
Now, you are healed.

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:32.320
Use your courage.

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:33.860
Use your own legs.

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:44.210
Thank you, Lord Michael!

00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:47.420
It's a miracle!

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:55.050
If you follow Lord Michael, you will be able to obtain eternal life.

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:58.390
Now, give your life and soul to him,

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:01.180
and obtain eternal life in Heaven.

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:09.070
Lord Michael... Lord Michael...

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:21.620
It feels like I've met you 100 years-

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:24.870
No, maybe even 500 years ago.

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:27.920
In our home town, the Obi-river.

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:38.050
I feel that we'll meet each other very soon.

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:47.310
How many times do I have to tell you?!

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:50.020
The old man is rising up too early!

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:51.110
He's useless now.

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:51.770
Kill him!

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:53.860
Understood.

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:56.280
Also, that Asian with those unpleasant eyes...

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:59.660
He might be an undercover agent.

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:00.780
Keep a close eye on him.

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:03.290
I've already dispatched a surveillance team to watch him.

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:16.970
Where's the money?

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:19.010
I've donated it.

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:21.470
All 300,000 dollars?

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:22.430
That's right.

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:23.930
To Lord Michael.

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:25.470
Lord Michael?

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:27.140
Do you think I'll believe that?

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:28.770
Don't believe me, then.

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:33.270
I'll slowly have you tell us the whereabouts of the money.

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:35.730
I'm sorry, Karen.

00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:39.990
I've become a criminal in order to avenge your death.

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:49.960
I guess we have no choice.

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:52.330
Let's go ask that Michael dude.

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:06.720
All the martial arts training will be handled by me.

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:08.100
Got it?

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:12.730
Always think about how you may be of help to Lord Michael,

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:18.740
and become an active soldier in order to protect him as soon as possible.

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:36.250
It's a restricted area beyond this point.

00:11:42.090 --> 00:11:43.760
He returned to his room.

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:57.690
Nothing's wrong.

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:04.780
There's a sniper that's trying to take my life?

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:08.370
Yes, that's what we heard from our spy in the police.

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:10.250
There's no doubt about it.

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:12.120
They say that if he targets you,

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:16.790
even the President of the USA wouldn't be able to survive, all because he is the best sniper.

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:19.130
It's him, I know it.

00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:21.630
Did the CIA hire him?

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:22.550
Or was it the FBI?

00:12:22.550 --> 00:12:26.720
It seems like it was an officer in the NYPD.

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:27.550
An officer?

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:31.560
It seems like he borrowed money from gangsters in order to hire him.

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:33.310
It's that Asian man.

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:34.650
Get rid of him immediately!

00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:35.150
Yes, sir.

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:00.250
He escaped!

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:02.210
Seal off all the exits!

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:03.340
Don't let anyone out!

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:24.610
According to Karen's report,

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:32.330
Michael really believes that a messenger will come and turn the dead into Gods of Death.

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:38.290
That's why he preserves the dead in a small pool underground.

00:13:53.020 --> 00:13:54.350
A gangster?

00:13:54.350 --> 00:13:55.890
Stupid idiots.

00:13:55.890 --> 00:14:02.150
They told us the 300,000 dollars that the police donated was our money, and told us to give it back.

00:14:02.150 --> 00:14:04.780
Did an officer really donate 300,000 dollars?

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:06.650
Was there such a donation?

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:08.030
No.

00:14:08.030 --> 00:14:11.830
They said that it was what the officer had said before he died.

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:14.370
Stupid idiots.

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:23.340
An assassin that was hired to assassinate Lord Michael is on the loose inside the building.

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:24.840
As soon as you locate him, kill him.

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:27.760
Now what-

00:14:43.070 --> 00:14:47.400
It seems that he's hiding underground and unarmed.

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:50.240
Quickly kill him for Lord Michael!

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:07.840
Quickly turn on the backup power!

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:09.720
Gather as much flashlights as possible!

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:10.970
Hurry!

00:15:11.550 --> 00:15:12.760
Hey, hurry!

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:16.350
It's him!

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:19.350
No, I'm on your side!

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:20.640
Stop!

00:15:21.150 --> 00:15:22.860
Calm down, don't shoot!

00:15:58.020 --> 00:15:59.640
He's the one.

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:03.440
He's the one who will bind a contract with the devil and bring up the dead.

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:07.730
It seems like the man I have waited for so long is my enemy...

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:09.440
What must we do?

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:12.360
Send all my men after him.

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:18.660
But then we won't be able to blow up the target by the date requested by our clients.

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:20.250
I don't care.

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:22.660
I am God, yet he attempted to kill me.

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:26.920
If the client doesn't like it, then tell him that we'll kill him.

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:28.630
We have a lot of clients.

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:29.300
Get it?

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:29.670
Yes, sir.

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:45.850
Lord Michael-

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:32.130
What did you say?

00:18:32.130 --> 00:18:33.630
An underground sewer?

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:35.880
I'm sorry.

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:39.340
He fled into New York's sewage tunnels... they're like mazes.

00:18:39.340 --> 00:18:44.680
We are experiencing some difficulty, but we'll make sure that he won't be able to enter here.

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:45.390
So, please be at ease.

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:03.700
All wiped out?

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:05.700
Yes, sir.

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:07.700
We've lost contact with all of our soldiers.

00:19:08.910 --> 00:19:11.580
The knights of my holy army...

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:13.710
...wiped out by just a single person?

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:18.840
If we dispatch more of them, we'll lose our defense here.

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:20.720
Lord Michael.

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:23.550
Lord Michael?

00:19:25.470 --> 00:19:26.720
I am fine.

00:19:29.060 --> 00:19:31.690
What will you do about tonight's gathering?

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:32.730
Gathering?

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:37.730
You were going to show miracles to the followers tonight.

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:40.450
No problem, we'll do it just as planned.

00:19:40.450 --> 00:19:42.360
We've lost a lot of soldiers.

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:44.990
We must raise them even quicker.

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:45.660
Yes, sir.

00:19:47.990 --> 00:19:49.000
Wait...

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:52.750
You said he escaped into the sewage...

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:57.630
There's a manhole connected to the sewage at the underground gathering place...

00:19:57.960 --> 00:20:00.760
Gather the security underground.

00:20:05.390 --> 00:20:06.760
Search around!

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:20.690
Look!

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:21.990
There's dirt.

00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:24.490
He moved it not too long ago...

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:26.280
He must have passed through this way.

00:20:26.780 --> 00:20:28.830
Search around!

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:29.700
Yes, sir!

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:24.840
Save me!

00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:26.640
Please let me live!

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:28.140
It's the God of Death!

00:21:28.140 --> 00:21:29.970
The God of Death has been resurrected!

00:21:31.430 --> 00:21:32.640
Stop! Don't run away!

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:35.100
Save Lord Michael!

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:38.270
Lord Michael!

00:21:38.270 --> 00:21:39.820
I'll save you now!

00:21:39.820 --> 00:21:41.070
You fucking God of Death!

00:22:33.580 --> 00:22:38.870
It doesn't matter anymore

00:22:39.620 --> 00:22:44.380
Who craved freedom first

00:22:45.550 --> 00:22:53.310
How we decided to part, and how we loved each other

00:22:53.310 --> 00:22:55.600
As nostalgic and simply just that

00:22:55.640 --> 00:23:03.690
Once you've lost it you'll feel lonely

00:23:03.900 --> 00:23:07.530
You may have to overcome the pain

00:23:07.690 --> 00:23:12.820
Many times with that cruel heart of yours

00:23:12.910 --> 00:23:21.120
But you just can't become as strong as you've imagined

00:23:22.670 --> 00:23:25.670
It was just a dream

00:23:25.670 --> 00:23:29.050
So let us return to tomorrow

00:23:29.090 --> 00:23:34.100
In this calm night

00:23:34.100 --> 00:23:36.260
There'll only be wanderers

00:23:36.390 --> 00:23:41.390
But now you've awakened, so walk down that path of yours

00:23:41.480 --> 00:23:47.400
And even though time is fleeting

00:23:47.530 --> 00:23:53.910
People sometimes desire too much

00:24:01.540 --> 00:24:04.460
Assassination in Hawaii.

00:24:04.460 --> 00:24:07.380
An officer has a hunch that it was Golgo 13.

00:24:07.380 --> 00:24:12.840
He almost even caught him many, many years ago, too.

00:24:12.840 --> 00:24:14.840
Time has changed him,

00:24:15.720 --> 00:24:20.680
he told Golgo to leave the island immediately, and stood in his way.

00:24:20.810 --> 00:24:26.110
Afterglow

00:24:21.480 --> 00:24:23.440
Next episode in Golgo 13:

00:24:23.440 --> 00:24:24.900
Afterglow.

00:24:24.900 --> 00:24:26.980
If you value your life

00:24:26.980 --> 00:24:28.730
don't stand behind him.
